wikitext:
Used to put an upcoming match in the spotlight on the startpage.

This particular template displays <mark>only 1 playername/teamname</mark>.<br />
* For a version with player/teamname + an array of players, see {{Tl|MatchAbbr}}.
* For a version with 2 individual players with a common flag, see {{Tl|Match2on2}}.

== Example ==
The code:
<pre>{{match|Mutilator|se|Rock|fi|date=20 February 2022 20:00|event=Duelmania Worldwide 2|info=Grudge Match|stream=hemostick}}</pre>

gives us:{{Col}}
===Game in spotlight===
{{match|Mutilator|se|Rock|fi|date=20 February 2022 20:00|event=Duelmania Worldwide 2|info=Grudge Match|stream=hemostick}}

===Tournaments===
{{Upcoming}}
{{Event|Upcoming tournament 1|date=?|link=false|i=}}
{{Event|Upcoming tournament 2|date=?|link=false|i=}}
{{Endcal}}
{{Col-break}}
{{EndCol}}

<br />
